# warp.demi — verb-cell manifest for the WARP (Alcubierre space-folding
# propulsion) domain. UFO Stage-4 stage independent domain elevation.
# SSOT scripts in ~/core/hexa-lang/stdlib/warp/ (NOT YET WIRED — stub)
# Generic dispatcher: ~/core/hexa-lang/stdlib/cockpit/cellrun.hexa
#
# Citations: Alcubierre, M. (1994) Class. Quantum Grav. 11, L73 — original
# warp metric; UFO/warp/hexa-*.md — in-tree spec + 13-falsifier preregister.
#
# Domain caveat: WARP cells are ALL ⚪ SPECULATION-FENCED at v1.0.0 —
